{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 12, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark gentle traveler a journey to Nippon awaits\nA schedule most grand for fortunate fates.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo's Realm**\n\nFrom distant shores thou shalt arrive at Narita's gate\nA taxi's swift passage to Shinjuku's estate.\nLodgings prepared a room of grace and cheer\nThen wander forth to banish all fear.\nThe Shinjuku Gyoen a garden serene\nWhere blossoms unfold a vibrant scene.\nDinner awaits a feast of delights\nRamen's warm broth banishing nights.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Wonders Unfold**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple a journey we take\nSenso-ji's grandeur for goodness sake.\nNakamise-dori a market so bright\nWith trinkets and treats a glorious sight.\nThen Shibuya's crossing a human cascade\nA spectacle grand expertly made.\nHarajuku's fashions a colorful show\nWhere youthful exuberance doth freely flow.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Mountainous Grace**\n\nHakone's mountains a vista sublime\nA cruise on Lake Ashi defying all time.\nMount Fuji's peak a majestic display\nA painter's delight come what may.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum a wondrous art\nSculptures and nature playing a vital part.\nReturn to Tokyo a weary but pleased soul\nPrepared for adventures to make thee whole.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nA bullet train's speed a swift journey made\nTo Kyoto's city where history's laid.\nGion's district geishas a fleeting grace\nA glimpse of old Japan in this magical place.\nKiyomizu-dera Temple a wooden delight\nPanoramic views bathed in golden light.\nDinner in Pontocho a riverside view\nReflecting the lanterns a shimmering hue.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a golden gleam\nA reflection in water a waking dream.\nRyoan-ji's garden a Zen mystery\nFifteen stones placed for all eyes to see.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove a verdant maze\nWhere sunlight filters in hazy rays.\nNijo Castle's grandeur a shogun's domai